        "original_id": "48aafdb4-290a-567e-98ff-6438131dcf6c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Breeds: Large Münsterländer, Bracco Italiano, German Longhaired Pointer\n- Places: Münster region, Germany, Italy\n- Dog types: gun dog, versatile gun dog\n- Related breeds: German Shorthaired Pointer, German Wirehaired Pointer\n\nFacts:\n- The Large Münsterländer, also called the Großer Münsterländer, is a breed of gun dog originally from the Münster region in Germany.\n- The Bracco Italiano is a breed of dog developed in Italy as a versatile gun dog.\n- The German Longhaired Pointer is closely related to the German Shorthaired Pointer, the German Wirehaired Pointer, and the Large Münsterländer.\n- The Large Münsterländer was previously part of the German Longhaired Pointer breed.",
